OL,3,GNEWSAAmbulance staff face sexual abuse
OL,4,A'almost daily'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondon Ambulance crews and call
OL,7,Fhandlers have said they face sexual
OL,8,Fabuse almost every day while helping
OL,9,Fpatients.
OL,11,FThis includes sexual threats, groping,
OL,12,Findecent exposure, explicit comments
OL,13,Fand sexual violence.
OL,15,FAlmost a third of emergency phone
OL,16,Foperators have experienced sexual
OL,17,Fharassment, while paramedics face
OL,18,Fphysical sexual abuse on top of the
OL,19,Finappropriate comments made "almost
OL,20,Fdaily", the London Ambulance Service
OL,21,F(LAS) said.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
