OL,3,GNEWSAAmbulance staff face sexual abuse
OL,4,A'almost daily'
OL,5,
OL,6,FParamedic Gosha Graf said she was
OL,7,Fassessing a patient when he groped her
OL,8,Fand then refused further care. When she
OL,9,Fread his notes, she discovered that he
OL,10,Fhad sexually assaulted another
OL,11,Fparamedic earlier that day after also
OL,12,Frefusing treatment.
